---

scripts/render-sounds.js contains a port of the audio graph from cuelume
(https://cuelume.dev, https://github.com/Danilaa1/cuelume), and the cue recipes
are imported from that package at render time.

cuelume is Copyright (c) Daniel Belyi and is likewise MIT licensed. Its full
license text ships with the dependency at node_modules/cuelume/LICENSE.
